license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Sources, pinned Lean proofs and Python verification for the classification
  of positive integers divisible by every decimal digit of every positive
  divisor. Includes the exact adopted prefix through index 46, independently
  verified below 10^24, and a reproducible auxiliary catalog-based derivation
  through index 101 with explicitly external primality and coverage premises.
